    {
      "title": "Log In",
      "desc": "Commands carry tags",
      "detail": "Every command starts with a tag the app chooses, like a1, and the server ends its answer with the same tag. That way several commands can be in flight and each reply is matched up. Lines starting with * are untagged data.",
